{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b8e23591e9d78360aebaedf9cc585858a9a96475ec1db8302c325df195ff1381",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62f03fcfec6385f90658119cc92f3010ba6899aa2dff7361e157479cfdf20b5a",
      "text": "怎么说呢，最近的花音总觉得坐立不安的啊。\n经常想一个人呆着，是发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d2ff25edaf5d11d797b8747948f2f5e3a3a30881433b9ee602edf4b7fb2417",
      "text": "（志狼君原来还没发现啊……\n制作人，该怎么办呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d049b9e0180c15adf987c02d38350cddabfc2a905def31c09cd6b9b6218f1f5",
      "text": "（先瞒着志狼君吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74983afef57a3d72922f4984963ff3fb518635450ec7df37bc367566fce8390a",
      "text": "也许只是那种心情吧。我偶尔\n也会想一个人呆着的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8215b3c647dd4369e8f6f1d5b12826844823f0d9d9d333c04db3f5d08d742402",
      "text": "对啦！花音不在正好。\n那个的事，还没定下来对吧，那个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ea785156c45bedbe50e7e883252900232561dfadaca8489d72594d2179ea76",
      "text": "是指花音君的生日蛋糕吧！\n这本册子里看中哪个了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0fd2a13ee7a5be09ec1538b1eee06c1714cbafdb6d4d8b97aca3ad04860607a",
      "text": "小兔子蛋糕怎么样？\n……比如这一页上登的这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3a554ef81104870d47e38034b5ef50b0cc0dc63a98b34a2f1b466dc06889214",
      "text": "大赞成——！\n那家伙超喜欢兔子，绝对会高兴疯的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfe9707c6136bad3ba63db96994e03241d02bc70b76a705d5b35d87d4ef4f804",
      "text": "啊！祝福语巧克力牌，\n好像我们自己也能写呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d0fc6f10dc7f1a1ede095ea5a0239a5b0592e352151f20ed5f193ee84030ccd",
      "text": "呐，由我们来写好不好？\n写“花音生日快乐”这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39638a5ef5a7c93f9c5027a5d044f03b81b9f5df8182e1f089ae71e62acdca12",
      "text": "嗯，好主意。\n制作人也能帮忙写吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000123:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000123:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
